DESCRIPTION:Hi Team \n\nWith this meeting we need to clarify:\n     i) the 
 exact data being queried and imported for the report.\n    ii) the logic be
 hind the report's structure and analysis\n   iii) WHY many values are highl
 ighted in red without a corresponding legend or KPI measurement explanation
 .\n    iv) IF all relevant activities are tracked and all necessary data is
  imported correctly.\n\n1. MEETING GOALS\n   i) CLARITY ON TRACKED ACTIVITI
 ES AND DATA: Achieve a comprehensive understanding of the activities being 
 tracked and the data queried into the EOD Chart Simulator\n    a) AIM: ensu
 re that  client communication is ACCURATE\n  ii) REPORT ADJUSTMENT STRATEGY
 : Develop a strategy to adjust the report for more effective data visualiza
 tion\,\n    a) AIM: to reduce the presence of "red values" > currently they
  seem uncorrelated.\n\n@barbie: we will use the information gathered fhere 
 to support the writing of the educational content on how to generate this r
 eport.\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
