 t with the following additions:<br><br>i) Identify which Analysts from the 
 Transaction Monitoring team (John Havoc\, Pearl Jezreel Ilao\, Ma. Theresa 
 Delos Santos\, Rellie Joy Peralta\, Maria Jane Valerie Dela Cruz) have also
  contributed to SLS PEP tasks during the day.<br><br>ii) Record and include
  the exact amount of time each analyst has dedicated to SLS PEP activities.
  This data is available on the tracker at: <a href="https://docs.google.com
 /spreadsheets/d/1aPr8Q89Z7HaWA2QYelSqMnFHVkk5SPx23JNov5IuGB0/edit#gid=20404
 90121" class="pastedDriveLink-1">20211115 Side-Activity Tracker</a><br><br>
 Please prepare ideas for streamlining this reporting process to discuss in 
 this upcoming meeting.<br><br>Thank you.\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
