DESCRIPTION:Hello Everyone!<br><br>As we continue to promote an Outward Min
 dset within our organization\, we are extending the "<b>Radical Engagement:
  Developing &amp\; Implementing Outward Mindset</b>" and "<b>Assessing Impa
 ct</b>" workshops to more members of our company. We are pleased to inform 
 you that you have been selected to attend the upcoming face-to-face worksho
 p.<br><br>Please refer to the details of the workshop below:<br><br><b>Date
 :</b> Thursday\, July 4\, 2024<br><b>Time:</b> 9 AM - 8 PM<br><b>Venue:</b>
  Kuala Lumpur Conference Room<br><br>Moreover\, to ensure you are well-prep
 ared for the upcoming workshops\, we have compiled a set of recommended lea
 rning materials for you to review:<br><ul><li><a href="https://drive.google
 .com/file/d/1iYBf5SZ1bY3P2YOKcQ1AUfjdRAaZqOl1/view?usp=drive_link" class="p
 astedDriveLink-0">Radical Engagement - Developing &amp\; Implementing Outwa
 rd Mindset</a><br></li><li><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1UiQ9gW
 DQlV_CSxV8PmjfyN7zAu6WDpoa/view?usp=drive_link" class="pastedDriveLink-2">R
 adical Engagement Workbook</a><br></li><li><a href="https://drive.google.co
 m/file/d/1uUtD_NQWj6XQ2AqZqGpSgdd5oyzQr28I/view?usp=drive_link" class="past
 edDriveLink-3">Assessing Impact</a></li></ul>Thank you\, and we're excited 
 to meet you at the workshop!\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
